 <h3><u>Asadullah ali (ayyam e ali)</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ali, ali haider maula..(2)<br> Haaye,<br> Aaj ke suraj ne khabar kaisi sunayi<br> aasmaa'n deta hai duhayi<br> rone lagi saari khudayi<br> uth gaya zainab o kulsoom ke sar se saaya..(2)<br> nauha jibreel ye karte the khudaya<br> Asadullah ali, ali haider maula<br> Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Wo ali jisko ataa rabb se hue tegh o alam<br> uski gardan mein rasan bandhi gayi haaye sitam<br> wajhullah ali.. ali haider maula<br> aayi kufe ke gali kucho se bus ek sadaa<br> Allah mere Allah<br> kis tarha ghum ye qayamat ka uthega</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>2. Jiske chehre ki ziyarat ho ibadat ki sanad<br> shab ki tanhayi mein karta tha ghareebo ki madad<br> hay yadullah ali.. ali haider maula<br> tegh jab sar pe lagi chehra hua khoon mein tarr<br> Allah mere Allah<br> farsh e ghum saniye zehra ne bichaya</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>3. Jisne bin dekhe khuda ko kabhi sajda na kiya<br> us namazi pe hui sajda e khaliq mein jafa<br> ayah ali.. ali haider maula<br> khana e fatima zehra mein gayi ghum ki khabar<br> Allah mere Allah<br> phaika shabbir ne ye kehke amaama</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>4. Jiske abroo ke ishare pe chale shams o qamar<br> aise insaan pe girya na kare shams o qamar<br> yuridullah ali.. ali haider maula<br> baap ko ghusl o kafan dete hi shabbar ne kaha<br> Allah mere Allah<br> hashr tak royega ye kehke zamana</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>5. Warise ilm e nabi natiq e qur'an ali<br> hai tere ghum me jaha'n chaak garibaan aali<br> lisaah ali.. ali haider maula<br> nauha ye baap ke taboot pe zainab ne kiya<br> Allah mere Allah<br> baba aghaaz hua karbobala ka</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>6. Khana e fatima zahra mein qayamat hai bapa<br> koi matam mein hai masroof koi mehwe buka<br> kaaba rota hai ali.. ali haider maula<br> betiya'n nauha kuna khaak udate hai pisar<br> Allah mere allah<br> thaam ke qalb o jigar kehti hai fizza</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>7. Ghar ke darwaze talak zainab e nashaad chali<br> saath taboot ke jibreel ki faryaad chali<br> kaisa girya hai.. ali ali haider maula<br> ambiya karte hue bayn falak se utre<br> Allah mere Allah<br> farsh se arsh talak shor yehi tha</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>8. Mazhar o Irfan ye ghum sab se bada hai<br> zakhm jo zainab ko yatimi ka mila hai<br> Roke zainab ne kaha, kaash aajaye qaza<br> maa ka ghum bhuli nahi thi ke mila baap ka ghum<br> Allah mere Allah<br> mujhko taa hashr rulayega ye jumla</p> 
  <p>Asadullah ali.. shere khuda qatl hua..(3)</p> 
  <p>Azamallahu ujuruna wa ujurukum<br> be musabina maula ali</p> 
